chromium-seccomp.json is derived from the Docker/Moby default seccomp profile:
https://github.com/moby/profiles/blob/main/seccomp/default.json
Retrieved 2026-11-18. Upstream license: Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE in this folder).

Canvas modification: allow clone, setns, unshare and chroot so non-root Chromium
can construct its namespace sandbox while the container drops all capabilities.
No other upstream syscall rules are changed.
